[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0010","text":"——嗯……谢谢你。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0020","text":"哎呀…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0030","text":"……谢谢。\n那，回头见。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0040","text":"……抱歉，我不是故意偷听的。\n只是采购回来的路上……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0050","text":"没事，不用在意"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0060","text":"只是被熟人邀请去参加一个工作坊而已。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0070","text":"原来是这样。你把日程告诉我的话，我来帮你调整——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0080","text":"没关系。\n我已经拒绝了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0090","text":"……可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500400_01_0100","text":"在演唱会之前，我不想打乱自己的节奏。"}]
